              "**Calculate the swing for each input.** Subtract the lower output from the higher one.",
              "**Rank and chart.** Sort inputs by swing, largest first, and draw a tornado chart.",
              "**Find switching values for the top inputs.** For the two or three widest bars, calculate how far the input can move before the output crosses your threshold, such as zero NPV or the contractual deadline.",
              "**Act and record.** Focus estimating, risk responses and contract terms on the top inputs. Record ranges, sources and results so others can review and repeat them.",
